# SearchPanel 内联搜索面板

## 基础用法

### SearchPanel
:::TuffDemoWrapper{demo="SearchPanelSearchPanelDemo" code-lang="vue" title="实时过滤与键盘导航" description="↑ ↓ 移动、Enter 选中、Esc 清空；三个字符起才显示空态。"}
---
code: |
  <template>
    <TxSearchPanel v-model="query" :items="items" @select="run" />
  </template>

  <script setup lang="ts">
  const items = [
    { id: 'a', label: 'Forecast summer demand' },
    { id: 'b', label: 'Find waffle cone suppliers', keywords: ['vendor'] },
    { id: 'c', label: 'Retire low sellers', disabled: true },
  ]
  </script>
---
